   "title": "Downloads + requirements",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Downloads + requirements\n\nClick the file name to download it. Put it in the folder shown (inside `ComfyUI/models/`).\n\n| Folder | File (click = download) | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `diffusion_models/` | [qwen_image_layered_fp8mixed.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-Layered/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/qwen_image_layered_fp8mixed.safetensors) | 20.5 GB |\n| `text_encoders/` | [qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors) | 9.38 GB |\n| `vae/` | [qwen_image_layered_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-Layered/resolve/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_layered_vae.safetensors) | 0.25 GB |\n\nThe text encoder is the same file Qwen-Image and HunyuanVideo 1.5 use. The VAE is special (it decodes transparency): the normal Qwen-Image VAE will not work. Full-precision model (40.9 GB, not tested here): `qwen_image_layered_bf16.safetensors` in the same Comfy-Org repo.\n\n**VRAM:** on the 24 GB card ComfyUI fills it (22.7 GiB). Started with --reserve-vram for a 12 GiB budget it peaked at 12.3 GiB (13.2 GiB whole card); in a 10 GiB budget at 10.2 GiB (11.1 GiB whole card). Same pixels, 4-12% slower. Not verified on a real 12 GB card. System RAM needed was not measured.\n\n**Run on ComfyUI 0.45.3** (older versions were not tested). **No custom nodes.**\n\nLicence: Qwen-Image-Layered is Apache 2.0.\n"
   ]
  }
